add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add set ip ferm recent_SSH { type ipv4_addr; size 65535; flags dynamic,timeout; }
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add chain ip ferm guard
add rule ip ferm INPUT update @recent_SSH { ip saddr timeout 1m limit rate over 8/minute burst 7 packets } goto guard
add rule ip ferm INPUT update @recent_SSH { ip saddr timeout 1m limit rate over 8/minute burst 7 packets }
add rule ip ferm guard drop
